{
  "id": "poem-6272cb369403774702e2c10d",
  "title": "前腔",
  "author": "柯丹邱《荆钗记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "［外］幽闲，食可加餐。",
    "官无事扰，情怀并没愁烦。",
    "人老花残，于心尚有相关。",
    "待招赘百岁姻亲，承继我一脉根蔓。",
    "［合前］。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-8032",
